    {
      "id": "p0129-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Two married guard dogs block the way. The dogs can smell that a human is nearby, but can't quite find the source of the smell. The dogs, named Dogamy and Dogaressa, converse before battling the human:",
        "raw": "Two married guard dogs block the way. The dogs can smell that a human is\nnearby, but can't quite find the source of the smell. The dogs, named Dogamy\nand Dogaressa, converse before battling the human:",
