      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "However, these \"bomb\" references didn't match the dogs' axe-themed attacks in battle, and they suggested that the dogs wanted to defecate on the main character. So the translator tried a different solution:",
        "raw": "However, these \"bomb\" references didn't match the dogs' axe-themed attacks\nin battle, and they suggested that the dogs wanted to defecate on the main\ncharacter. So the translator tried a different solution:",
